  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b3e41419-4fc3-4fae-9d2a-89a3f25c7981",
    "name": "NATS Reference Platform",
    "description": "Production-like Postman collection for NATS JetStream Publisher and Consumer APIs.\n\n### Prerequisites\n1. Ensure NATS server is running with JetStream enabled (`nats-server -js`).\n2. Ensure required streams exist via NATS CLI:\n   - PAYMENTS: `nats stream add PAYMENTS --subjects 'payments.>' --storage file --retention limits --discard old --replicas 3 --defaults`\n   - DELIVERY: `nats stream add DELIVERY --subjects 'delivery.>' --storage file --retention limits --discard old --dupe-window 2m --replicas 3 --defaults`\n3. Ensure Order Service is running on `http://localhost:8080` (`go run ./services/cmd/order-service`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Publishing",
      "description": "Endpoints for publishing messages demonstrating At-Most-Once, At-Least-Once, and Exactly-Once delivery semantics.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "NATS Publish (AtMost Once)",
