                "publish",
                "js"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Publishes a message to JetStream synchronously with at-least-once delivery semantics and returns the native PubAck object containing the stream name, sequence number, domain, and duplicate status. Target subject can be delivery.atleast-once (processing-service) or payments.created (payment-worker)."
